An other author made another ocaml-util(s) lib,  
we are not aware what is the exact name of this  
lib in order to avoid "name-clash" between this  
lib, and this one.

Possible re-names, in order to avoid name-clash:  
- "ocaml-utils"
- "ocaml-util"

- "ocaml-utils-lib"
- "ocaml-util-lib"

- "ocaml-lib-utils"
- "ocaml-lib-util"

- "ocaml-libutils"
- "ocaml-libutil"

- "ocaml-utilslib"
- "ocaml-utillib"

- "ocaml-utlib"

In case you redistribute this set of modules,  
please re-name it accordingly.

